<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID BEAT WIDZEW LODZ 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID BEAT WIDZEW LODZ 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atletico Madrid beat Widzew Lodz 1-0</p>
<p>in their European Cup Champions' League group B match on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Milinko Pantic 83</p>
<p>Attendance: 23,000</p>
</text>
